flowchart TD
    A[Receive exception record] --> B{Payload valid?}
    B -- No --> X[P1 / manual review / withhold routing]
    B -- Yes --> C{Category supported?}
    C -- No --> Y[Manual review / no inferred action]
    C -- Yes --> D{Financial risk or repeat count >= 3?}
    D -- Yes --> E[P1 / human review required]
    D -- No --> F{Customer impact and age >= 24h?}
    F -- Yes --> E
    F -- No --> G{Customer impact or age >= 12h or repeat count >= 2?}
    G -- Yes --> H[P2]
    G -- No --> I[P3]
    E --> J[Assign category owner and recommend next step]
    H --> J
    I --> J
    Y --> K[Do not execute operational action]
    X --> K
    J --> L[Return priority, evidence, route and review flag]
    L --> M[No order mutation or external side effect]
